<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="Check danger signs for mothers and newborn babies in the first year after birth. A research prototype." />
  <!-- Same-origin assets only: no CDN, which matters for a low-bandwidth audience. -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css" />
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><text y='26' font-size='26'>🤱</text></svg>" />
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-cream text-ink antialiased">

  <header class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-4">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🤱</span>
        <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">MamaTriage</span>
      </a>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">
        Research prototype
      </span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!--
    The emergency instruction sits above everything, on every page. If someone lands here
    while their baby is in danger, reading a description of the service is the wrong thing
    for them to do next.
  -->
  <div class="border-b border-red-200 bg-red-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-2.5 text-center text-sm text-red-900">
      <strong>If this is an emergency, go to your nearest health facility now.</strong>
      Do not wait for a reply here.
    </div>
  </div>

  <main><%- body %></main>

  <footer class="mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-3 px-5 py-8 text-sm text-slate-600">
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">
        MamaTriage is a research prototype. It is not a doctor and does not give diagnoses.
      </p>
      <p>
        Built for the MSc Information Technology programme, MIVA Open University, Abuja.
        Clinical guidance is drawn from WHO IMCI and Federal Ministry of Health Nigeria
        publications. Not a medical device, and not for use in place of care.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-500">
        We store an anonymous copy of conversations for research. Phone numbers are never
        saved in readable form.
      </p>
      <p class="flex gap-4 pt-1">
        <a href="/privacy" class="font-medium text-brand underline">Privacy notice</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="font-medium text-brand underline">Terms of use</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="/assets/htmx.min.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
